cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite the paper below."
title: BayesDesign
abstract: >-
  Protein sequence design that maximizes the Boltzmann probability
  p(structure | sequence) via a ratio of probability models (ProteinMPNN /
  ProtXLNet), targeting stability and conformational specificity.
